module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.unrecognized_primary_expression_lowers_to_its_first_atom_at_v2_body_lowering

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import std.decl_ref { DeclarationRef, WholeDeclaration }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data unrecognized_primary_expression_lowers_to_its_first_atom_at_v2_body_lowering: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "unrecognized_primary_expression_lowers_to_its_first_atom_at_v2_body_lowering" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a primary expression the v2 primary readers do not recognize lowers to its FIRST ATOM, and normalize ACCEPTS the module** (INVALID STATE: a map literal `{ \"k\": v, .. }` lowers to the single atom `dag_token_lbrace`, and a module-qualified constructor literal `a.b.T { f: v }` lowers to the single atom `a`, its head path segment. Every key, field, value, the tag and the rest of the path are gone, with no diagnostic.) A name inside never reaches resolve, so an undeclared one is accepted, and every consumer of the value reads a brace token or a bare module segment where the source wrote a construction. The unqualified constructor literal, the qualified value path `a.b.X` and the qualified call `a.b.f(x)` lower in full (fixtures at 8bf4b66774c), so the class is the fall-through, not qualification or braces as such.",
    "RECEIPTS. Fixture, traced by a scratch normalized-tree dump over `v2.compiler.program_assembly` `program_assembly_phase_normalize` at main 8bf4b66774c: `data mp: Map<String, Bool> = { \"k1\": true, \"k2\": false }` lowers to arrow_body_edge -> Atom dag_token_lbrace. Census: `v2.compiler.reference_conservation_census` `reference_conservation_census_for_paths` over `reference_conservation_stratified_sample_paths` at 69e0bb7566e. About 43 of the 3,472 atoms absent in accepted modules are map-literal keys; this is a source-position heuristic. Qualified-constructor example: `v2.std.float` `v2.std.nat.Succ { prev: .. }` arms. Map example: the keyword tables of `extdeps.languages.rust.syntax`. The values in that census are mostly keyword atoms outside the reference population, so the census UNDERCOUNTS this class.",
    "WHERE, BY READING, NOT BY INSTRUMENTATION. In `v2.compiler.body_lowering_fold` `body_lower_primary_expr`, `body_lower_try_record_literal` finds no constructor tag on a map literal, and the chain falls through to `body_lower_pattern_first_atom_optional`. That answers the first atom under the braces: the `{` token. This is the same brace-token fallback `call_expression_erased_at_v2_body_lowering` recorded for calls. It is a separate row because that row's subject is the call population and its trigger is call lowering: a fixed call path leaves this shape where it is, which our fixtures show (calls lower in full at 8bf4b66774c, maps do not).",
    "RUNG FOUND AT: below the floor (silent wrongness). CEILING: structurally guaranteed. A map literal lowers to a construction carrying every key and value, or refuses at the literal. NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, NAMING THE CAPABILITY: v2 body lowering has a lowered form for map literals, or a typed refusal located at the literal. In either case a primary expression it cannot read refuses instead of answering its first atom. Owner: bright-boar-848's fold queue (quiet-seal-543, 2026-09-25). Pinned drops in `v2.test.claim.namespace_xl0.reference_conservation_accepted_drops`: `a_map_literal_value_is_reported_dropped_holds` and `a_qualified_constructor_literal_value_is_reported_dropped_holds`; each holds while the drop happens and reds when the repair lands.",
    "CLIMBED, THE TRIGGER CAPABILITY MET BY ITS REFUSAL ARM (bright-boar-848, XL-2). A primary the readers cannot read now refuses at the primary (`body_lowering_reason_unsupported_form`) instead of answering its first atom. The link was not the one this row named by reading: measured by calling each strategy of `v2.compiler.body_lowering_fold` `body_lower_primary_expr` on a map literal's capture, every strategy answered Absent and the value came from the LAST fall-back, `body_lower_operand_or_atom_read`, through `body_lower_pattern_leaf_atom_optional` -- a reader named leaf that searched a non-atom's children. That child search is correct for PATTERNS (a pattern capture `A { x: v }` is a sequence whose first atom IS its tag; making it a leaf read reddened eight pattern and let-in claims), so the classification of one atom now has one home (`body_lower_atom_node_lowered_optional`) under two readers: the pattern reader keeps its search, and the value fall-backs (primary, postfix, operand-or-atom) read `body_lower_value_sole_atom_optional`, which answers an atom only when the node IS one. Doing so exposed that the let-in value reader handed over value AND `in` continuation and leaned on the search to pull the value out; it now reads the value positionally (`body_lower_let_in_value_before_in`). The two pinned drops flip to refusal controls: each asserts the module is Rejected with fatal cause unsupported_form (a refused module still reports its atoms dropped, so the old drop claims stayed green vacuously). A LOWERED FORM for map literals and qualified constructor literals remains open: it needs modeled constructions, which is a design question for the parent before it is built. RUNG NOW: structurally guaranteed for the fall-back (DESIGN 4b rung 3): the source can still write a map or qualified-constructor literal, but no Accepted program lowers an unreadable primary to an atom it is not; the compiler refuses it at the primary on the real acceptance path, and the two refusal controls red if that refusal is removed. The lowered form stays open as stated above.",
    "2026-10-01, BOTH CONTROLS RE-STATED (sharp-tern-39; both were silently red on main outside the required gate). QUALIFIED CONSTRUCTOR: gunbc#12714 made the construct tag a declaration reference, so `a.b.T { f: v }` lowers whole and its module normalizes; the refusal control flipped to the conserved control `a_qualified_constructor_literal_value_is_conserved_holds` (accepted, field value conserved). MAP LITERAL: gunbc#12758 elaborates a map literal from its declared Map type, so `{ \"k\": v }` lowers whole and its module normalizes; the refusal control flipped to the conserved control `a_map_literal_value_is_conserved_holds`. Both lowered forms this row left open are now landed; the fall-back refusal (`body_lowering_reason_unsupported_form`) stands for any primary still unread.",
  ],

  evidence: [
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v2.test.claim.namespace_xl0.reference_conservation_accepted_drops", decl_name: "a_map_literal_value_is_conserved_holds", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v2.test.claim.namespace_xl0.reference_conservation_accepted_drops", decl_name: "a_qualified_constructor_literal_value_is_conserved_holds", field: WholeDeclaration },
  ],
}
